SUMMARY:Dirty Dancing: The Musical Early Access + Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: Early Access ends April 26\, 2026.
  I will post a comment with any future offers that come up prior to the ev
 ent.**\n\nOn **Sunday\, December 6th\, join us for Dirty Dancing: The Musi
 cal\, followed by our Holiday Dinner.** Dirty Dancing: The Musical\, the s
 tory that awakened a generation\, is back in a new stage production. This 
 feel-good escape you’ve been craving\, is alive with the pulse of electr
 ified dancing\, the thrill of secret encounters\, and the allure of forbid
 den romance. Set to live music from the original film you love\, Baby and 
 Johnny bring to life the summer that changed everything. My seat is Orches
 tra M25. **Purchase Dirty Dancing: The Musical on Sunday December 6th at 2
 pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular Cost: $59/ 79/ 99/ 129/ 149/ 219 + service fees
 \n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**Ticket Policy**: All sales are final\, n
 o refunds or exchanges.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes confirming if yo
 u will join for dinner after. Note: everyone goes on the waitlist until th
 ey post their seat number**\n* **[Purchase](https://tickets.mirvish.com/dd
 26/24439)** **your own ticket and select the December 6th date**\, post yo
 ur seat number and I will move you to going. The early access code is embe
 dded in the link. If you are having trouble\, please post a comment and I 
 will message you a response.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before wit
 h my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 5 da
 ys prior as dinner reservations are challenging for the Holidays\, and the
  Waitlist will be removed at that time. Cancellations will result in a No 
 Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for the S
 how at: 1:40pm inside the CAA Ed Mirvish Theatre at 244 Victoria St. (not 
 the Yonge St. entrance)**\, on the ground floor **to the right side after 
 scanning your tickets.**\n\n**Start: 2pm**\n\nLength: 2 hours 30 mins (inc
 l. intermission)\n\nAfter: meet at the same spot to chat about the show an
 d head out for our Holiday Dinner\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments i
 n the Event after.
